      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 7.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.61,
      "end_seconds": 11.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.08,
      "end_seconds": 29.11,
      "duration_seconds": 16.03,
      "text": "um, so... a high reading at home. That's why I came. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. My family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.49,
      "end_seconds": 37.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.99,
      "end_seconds": 53.9,
      "duration_seconds": 13.91,
      "text": "I mean, I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day. Simvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night. Mm, it's metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.44,
      "end_seconds": 56.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.79,
      "end_seconds": 77.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.43,
      "end_seconds": 82.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "for nearly five years, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.17,
      "end_seconds": 87.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "How troublesome is it it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.66,
      "end_seconds": 90.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "I'd say mild"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.81,
      "end_seconds": 91.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.52,
      "end_seconds": 108.23,
      "duration_seconds": 15.71,
      "text": "As for headaches in the mornings, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About headaches in the mornings, it feels severe to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.18,
      "end_seconds": 113.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Have you had any weakness, chest pain or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.77,
      "end_seconds": 117.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.46,
      "end_seconds": 125.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "have you had any vision changes or nosebleeds?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.02,
      "end_seconds": 130.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "No, no vision changes or nosebleeds."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.2,
      "end_seconds": 134.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.05,
      "end_seconds": 137.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Nothing there, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.03,
      "end_seconds": 144.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.53,
      "end_seconds": 149.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.34,
      "end_seconds": 152.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.33,
      "end_seconds": 160.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.8,
      "end_seconds": 163.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "So, is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.85,
      "end_seconds": 169.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.92,
      "end_seconds": 171.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.01,
      "end_seconds": 176.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.49,
      "end_seconds": 182.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.58,
      "end_seconds": 187.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.03,
      "end_seconds": 192.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.57,
      "end_seconds": 203.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure i, I have high cholesterol i've had diabetes for about a year now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.13,
      "end_seconds": 215.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.21,
      "text": "okay, I can see high blood pressure and high cholesterol in your file as well. Let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.94,
      "end_seconds": 227.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.5,
      "end_seconds": 245.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 159 over 97, respiratory rate 16, temp 36.6 degrees, pulse is 94 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.36,
      "end_seconds": 274.98,
      "duration_seconds": 15.62,
      "text": "So, based on your history, I think we're dealing with hypertension that isn't well controlled at this stage. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.16,
      "end_seconds": 278.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.49,
      "end_seconds": 287.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like hypertension that isn't well controlled"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.41,
      "end_seconds": 314.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Salt is the big one, try to keep it low even though it's hard. Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.73,
      "end_seconds": 316.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.03,
      "end_seconds": 323.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.75,
      "end_seconds": 327.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "so, alright, thanks, take care"
    }
  ]
